{"product_id":"swimmer-among-the-stars","title":"Swimmer among the stars","description":"\u003cp\u003eAn interview with the last speaker of a language. A chronicle of the final seven days of a town that is about to be razed to the ground by an invading army. The lonely voyage of an elephant from Kerala to a princess’s palace in Morocco. A fabled cook who flavours his food with precious stones. A coterie of international diplomats trapped in near-Earth orbit. These, and the other stories can be found in this collection.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tharoor Kanishk\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9789384067342\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 208\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 16 x 230\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750559850649,"sku":"2RC9789384067342","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/swimmer-among-the-stars-817654.jpg?v=1694791839","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/swimmer-among-the-stars","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}